{"4588400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Witchmarked", "steam_appid": 4588400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Witchmarked</strong></i> is a tabletop-inspired, <strong>turn-based roguelite strategy game</strong> set in a <strong>cursed</strong> medieval village gripped by madness. Once a year, the Witches take their revenge, turning the tables on the inhabitants who once cheered at their burning. <strong>Bound to a chair</strong> by the witches, your only choice is to <strong>outsmart</strong> your fellow villagers… <strong>or face the fire</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Table of Judgement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witches deal the <strong>Verdict Tablets</strong>: markers of life, death, and hollow mercy. Memorize their positions before the shuffle. <strong>Choose</strong> a tablet <strong>wisely</strong>, nominate a victim, and flip the stone. Pray the judgment strikes <strong>your neighbor and not you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/4f0d814961129ed3b872c347396382a4.poster.avif?t=1783478901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/4f0d814961129ed3b872c347396382a4.webm?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/4f0d814961129ed3b872c347396382a4.mp4?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your Cinderling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witches <strong>toss</strong> magic-imbibed <strong>scraps</strong> to the players. <strong>Buy them with blood</strong> to <strong>pin to your Cinderling doll</strong>. When cornered, hold your creation to the candle’s flame to <strong>ignite powerful hexes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/2baf41abdd084f5f98b1d514e5d94038.poster.avif?t=1783478901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/2baf41abdd084f5f98b1d514e5d94038.webm?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/2baf41abdd084f5f98b1d514e5d94038.mp4?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the odds stack against you, <strong>bargain</strong> for Witches’ <strong>favors</strong> to <strong>tilt the odds</strong> or peer into the deck. But remember: Payment is in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Witchmarked, you will…</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be dragged into a <strong>high-stakes</strong>  <strong>ritual</strong> ruled by witches and their cruel rhymes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face</strong> other doomed <strong>villagers</strong> while <strong>bound to a chair</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bargain</strong> and <strong>risk your life</strong> for <strong>Fatechanger</strong> Charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>Cinderling </strong>dolls from <strong>blood-bought scraps</strong> to <strong>unleash</strong> deadly <strong>hexes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve</strong> your <strong>strategy</strong> as the story introduces <strong>new twists</strong> and <strong>artifacts</strong> to the ritual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win</strong> with cunning… <strong>or burn</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Witchmarked</strong></i> is a tabletop-inspired, <strong>turn-based roguelite strategy game</strong> set in a <strong>cursed</strong> medieval village gripped by madness. Once a year, the Witches take their revenge, turning the tables on the inhabitants who once cheered at their burning. <strong>Bound to a chair</strong> by the witches, your only choice is to <strong>outsmart</strong> your fellow villagers… <strong>or face the fire</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Table of Judgement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witches deal the <strong>Verdict Tablets</strong>: markers of life, death, and hollow mercy. Memorize their positions before the shuffle. <strong>Choose</strong> a tablet <strong>wisely</strong>, nominate a victim, and flip the stone. Pray the judgment strikes <strong>your neighbor and not you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/4f0d814961129ed3b872c347396382a4.poster.avif?t=1783478901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/4f0d814961129ed3b872c347396382a4.webm?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/4f0d814961129ed3b872c347396382a4.mp4?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your Cinderling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witches <strong>toss</strong> magic-imbibed <strong>scraps</strong> to the players. <strong>Buy them with blood</strong> to <strong>pin to your Cinderling doll</strong>. When cornered, hold your creation to the candle’s flame to <strong>ignite powerful hexes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/2baf41abdd084f5f98b1d514e5d94038.poster.avif?t=1783478901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/2baf41abdd084f5f98b1d514e5d94038.webm?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/extras/2baf41abdd084f5f98b1d514e5d94038.mp4?t=1783478901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the odds stack against you, <strong>bargain</strong> for Witches’ <strong>favors</strong> to <strong>tilt the odds</strong> or peer into the deck. But remember: Payment is in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Witchmarked, you will…</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be dragged into a <strong>high-stakes</strong>  <strong>ritual</strong> ruled by witches and their cruel rhymes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face</strong> other doomed <strong>villagers</strong> while <strong>bound to a chair</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bargain</strong> and <strong>risk your life</strong> for <strong>Fatechanger</strong> Charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>Cinderling </strong>dolls from <strong>blood-bought scraps</strong> to <strong>unleash</strong> deadly <strong>hexes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve</strong> your <strong>strategy</strong> as the story introduces <strong>new twists</strong> and <strong>artifacts</strong> to the ritual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win</strong> with cunning… <strong>or burn</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Play for your life in a deadly ritual controlled by a coven of torch-happy witches. A candlelit fusion of deckbuilding, resource management, and turn-based strategy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/a9f397d77210f6d5da82252f950d31fad7614c2b/header.jpg?t=1783478901", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/4aa873f8016f8327de740fc26c09ed28cdeeae85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783478901", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588400/4aa873f8016f8327de740fc26c09ed28cdeeae85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783478901", "website": "https://7dgames.studio/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD Ryzen 5 (from 2017 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD Ryzen 5 (from 2019 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["7D Games Studi